    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "在零阶保持器（ZOH）假设下，存在精确的离散等效模型，因为零阶保持器准确描述了采样时刻之间 e 的行为，且输出 u 仅取决于采样时刻的输入 e(k)。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "With the ZOH assumption, there is an exact discrete equivalent because the ZOH precisely describes what happens between samples of e and the output u depends only on input at sample times e(k).",
